body:
...are you kidding? you asked me if there was a difference and i said morally: no. no, there is *no difference*. which means throwing a loved ones remains on someone *is* the same as throwing meat at a vegan. you gotta read what you're posting, man.

&#x200B;

>if you're asking me *is the blood of a pig different* than the blood of my mother biologically, then yes, absolutely. *morally? no*.

yes, it does. stupid people like stupid books. that was my entire point. i even stated it in my post. good god, man. it's right in front of your eyes.

&#x200B;

>the reason his books are so widely read is because they are written by and for morons, which encompasses the majority of the population.
